1
00:00:00,730 --> 00:00:03,070
(Leonard:)You told her my experiment
was stupid?

2
00:00:03,358 --> 00:00:05,398
(Howard:)I was just repeating
what Sheldon said.

3
00:00:06,569 --> 00:00:10,909
Look, let's not get off topic.
Bernadette, I need to apologize.

4
00:00:11,074 --> 00:00:14,414
You know, I was wrong to tell you
who you should be friends with.

5
00:00:14,577 --> 00:00:18,287
-Should I leave you two alone?
-No, Leonard, you should hear this.

6
00:00:18,456 --> 00:00:21,246
(Leonard:)Okay, good.
Because I wasn't really gonna go.

7
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:27,510
(Howard:)Look, I know I come off
as confident and worldly...

8
00:00:29,008 --> 00:00:30,798
(Howard:)...but the truth is I'm not.

9
00:00:30,969 --> 00:00:32,799
(Leonard:)We're shocked.

10
00:00:34,264 --> 00:00:38,014
(Howard:)Which is why I tend to feel threatened
by other guys.

11
00:00:38,184 --> 00:00:41,934
(Leonard:)Or loud noises, clowns and nuns.

12
00:00:43,857 --> 00:00:46,527
(Howard:)But I now realize how foolish that is.

13
00:00:46,693 --> 00:00:50,153
(Leonard:)He had a panic attack once
when he got his head stuck in his sweater.

14
00:00:51,447 --> 00:00:54,077
(Howard:)It was a full turtleneck.

15
00:00:54,242 --> 00:00:56,702
-And why aren't you helping me?
-I don't know.

16
00:00:56,870 --> 00:01:04,020
(Leonard:)Maybe because I'm crazy?

